WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.160
What I really love about GoSteady

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:06.040
is it enables me to watch
my mom’s activity in the night

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.500
to see how often she’s getting up
to go to the bathroom.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.000
My mom loves the cup holder itself.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.200
She thinks it’s the best invention ever

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.050
and it really encourages her
to drink more water.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.950
It’s a win-win-win all the way around.
